    <briefdescription>
<para>The visitors of a particle&apos;s stiffness that a host applies (Particle::describeStiffness()): the bound of its absolute value, for the critical time step of an explicit scheme, and its assembly. The particles do not include this header; both visitors and their free functions are compiled in Marmot, for nDim 2 and 3 (a host that compiled them with its own flags, e.g. with FMA contraction, would change the last bits of their results). </para>
